<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81348" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίζυξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠγος</span>,
			ὁ, ἡ, neut. pl.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίζυγα</span>, 
			Boeot.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίδδυγα</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>Schwyzer</u>
			462
		</span></i>
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>B</u>
			54
		</span></i> (Tanagra, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>over and above a pair</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἢν μή τις ἔχῃ περίζυγα</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάντα</span>) a <i>spare</i>
			strap, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				6.2.32
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνωτίδια π.</span>
			<i>odd</i> ear-rings, <u>Schwyzer</u> l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιζύγ[ων]</span>, of harness, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5633.4
			</span></i>(<span class="entity">Teos</span>): nom. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίζυξ</span> dub. sens. in <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				385
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				838
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1469.75
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>=<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμόζυγος, σύζυγος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
